ement , Major had a one-seat majority in the 651-seat House of Commons lower house of parliament . In his formal statement , Gorst said : \\\" I am today withdrawing my cooperation from the government and shall not treat the \\\" whip ' as either a summons to attend the House of Commons or as placing me under any obligation to vote as advised . \\\" Gorst resigned over a hospital closure in his constituency .\", \"entity_mentions\": [{\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Major\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [0, 5]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/John_Major\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"LONDON\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [52, 58]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/London\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"British\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [70, 77]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"John Major\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [93, 103]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/John_Major\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Conservative\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [140, 152]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Conservative_Party_(UK)\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"John Gorst\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [160, 170]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/John_Gorst_(Hendon_North_MP)\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Gorst\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [310, 315]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/John_Gorst_(Hendon_North_MP)\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Major\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": 