ns over the coast of Quintana Roo state . Winds from the northeast at 10 to 15 knots with waves three to five feet high . -- Chris Aspin , Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903\", \"entity_mentions\": [{\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Mexican\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [0, 7]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mexico\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"MEXICO CITY\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [49, 60]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mexico_City\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"GMT\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [122, 125]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Greenwich_Mean_Time\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Tampico\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [200, 207]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tampico\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Gulf of Mexico\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [464, 478]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gulf_of_Mexico\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Caribbean\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [481, 490]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Caribbean\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Pacific Coast\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [495, 508]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Pacific_coast\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Pacific Coast\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [513, 526]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Pacific_coast\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Baja California\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [569, 584]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org