ve barges , 30-day open , mid-Mississippi ( McGregor and south ) bid at 160 percent , offered at 170 percent , no comparisons . - 36 barges , two each week May-August , Illinois , offered at 130 percent of tariff , no bid or comparison . - 36 barges , two each week May-August , mid-Mississippi offered at a steady 135 percent , bid at 120 percent ( basis one each week ) . -- Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720\", \"entity_mentions\": [{\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"U.S.\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [0, 4]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"ST. LOUIS\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [45, 54]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/St._Louis\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"U.S.\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [66, 70]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"St. Louis\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [117, 126]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/St._Louis\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Illinois\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [229, 237]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Illinois\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Ohio\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [345, 349]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ohio\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Illinois\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [435, 443]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Illinois\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Illinois\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [683, 691]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Illinoi