, and deputy speaker Suraj Bhan suspended work until Monday . The destruction of the 16th-century mosque in the northern Indian town of Ayodhya triggered nationwide Hindu-Moslem violence in which more than 3,000 people were killed . Indian officials blame revenge-minded Moslem underworld gangs in Bombay for a string of bombings in the city three months later that killed 260 people . The BJP backs a hardline Hindu campaign to build a temple at the site of the mosque , which Hindus believe was the birthplace of the Lord Rama . The campaign catapulted BJP from the political fringe to become India 's main opposition party in 1991 .\", \"entity_mentions\": [{\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Hindu\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [0, 5]}, \"target_uri\": \"\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"India\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [19, 24]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/India\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"NEW DELHI\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [49, 58]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/New_Delhi\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Hindu\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [70, 75]}, \"target_uri\": \"\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"India\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [111, 116]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/India\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Hindu\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [292, 297]}, \"target_uri\": \"\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Bharatiya Janata Party\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [310, 332]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bharatiya_Janata_Party\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": 