n a report on border protection . The report , to be debated in parliament in coming weeks , was seen by Reuters on Friday . \\\" Officials say the minefields present an obstacle to the security forces , \\\" it said . It said Kurdistan Workers Party ( PKK ) guerrillas sometimes know the layout of mined areas along the border better than the security forces . \\\" Terrorists and smugglers have dug up the mines , defused them and opened up wide paths in some areas . They can come in and out easily as the minefields are not an obstacle , \\\" it said . An armed forces spokesman was not available for comment . Turkey says Syria sponsors the PKK , fighting for Kurdish self-rule in southeast Turkey . Damascus denies aiding the rebels . The PKK also crosses into Turkey from bases in the mountains of northern Iraq . More than 21,000 people have died in the 12-year-old conflict .\", \"entity_mentions\": [{\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Syrian\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [36, 42]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Syria\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"ANKARA\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [52, 58]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ankara\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Kurdish\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [99, 106]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kurdistan\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Syria\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [146, 151]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Syria\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Reuters\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [525, 532]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Reuters\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Kurdistan Workers Party\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position