 suitcase at a lost luggage office . The woman was later arrested in Belgium . She and the Turkish man smuggled heroin from Turkey to Antwerp from where it was taken to Spain , France and Germany by others , the spokesman said . He said 14 people were arrested in Belgium and 16 others in other European nations after an investigation lasting nearly a year . ( $ 1=32.14 Belgian Franc )\", \"entity_mentions\": [{\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Belgian\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [0, 7]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Belgium\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"BRUSSELS\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [55, 63]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Brussels\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Spain\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [161, 166]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Spain\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Belgian\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [222, 229]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Belgium\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Belgian\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [341, 348]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Belgium\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Antwerp\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [418, 425]}, \"target_uri\": \"\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Belgian\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [455, 462]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Belgium\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Barcelona\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [535, 544]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Barcelona\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\