Entity\", \"surface_form\": \"Greek\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [60, 65]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Greece\"}]}, {\"py/object\": \"data.text.TestText\", \"text\": \"German Jan-August coffee imports detailed . HAMBURG 1996-12-06 German net green coffee imports from outside the EU totalled 7.73 million bags in January-August compared with 7.66 million in the year-ago period , the DKV coffee association said . Imports of 1.04 million bags in August were down from 1.08 million in August 1995 but up from 992,860 bags in July 1996 . Colombia shipped 198,226 bags in August after 164,185 in July , El Salvador 160,553 ( 129,184 ) , Indonesia 72,218 ( 78,959 ) , Ethiopia 69,252 ( 60,456 ) and Kenya 63,969 ( 60,043 ) . Brazil was in seventh position with 54,333 bags ( 29,055 ) . -- Hamburg newsroom +49-40-41903275\", \"entity_mentions\": [{\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"German\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [0, 6]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Germany\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"HAMBURG\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [44, 51]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hamburg\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"German\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [63, 69]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Germany\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Colombia\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [368, 376]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Colombia\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"El Salvador\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [432, 443]}, \"target_uri\": \"http://dbpedia.org/resource/El_Salvador\"}, {\"py/object\": \"data.entity.TestEntity\", \"surface_form\": \"Indonesia\", \"ner_class\": \"\", \"position\": {\"py/tuple\": [466, 4